<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: FBD names Taheny group development manager.</title>
<headline>FBD names Taheny group development manager.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBD Insurance Plc said on Wednesday that it had appointed Adrian Taheny as group development manager.</p>
<p>Taheny, who joins from EBS Building Society where he had been general manager of marketing, will take up his new position in the near future, FBD said in a statement.</p>
<p>He will play a key management role in developing the group's insurance, assurance and financial services interests, it said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
